<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"></view><view class="topbar"><view class="back" bindtap="back"><image class="figma-back" src="/assets/figma/all/s23-imgFrame.svg"/></view><view class="top-title-main top-title">发布经历</view><view class="top-action" bindtap="save">保存草稿</view></view><view class="publish-safety-tip"><text class="publish-safety-icon">⚠</text><text>请分享亲身经历，不发布诊断或治疗结论</text></view><view class="section-title quick-title"><text>关联信息</text><text class="aside">关联后自动带入标签</text></view><view class="card card-pad row quick-associated" bindtap="chooseEvent"><view class="grow"><view>关联事件</view><view class="tiny">{{selectedEventLabel || '带入接触类型与经历阶段'}}</view></view><text wx:if="{{selectedEventId}}" class="event-selected" catchtap="clearEvent">移除</text><text wx:else class="event-selected">选择</text></view><view class="card card-pad row quick-associated" bindtap="planRoute"><view class="grow"><view>关联路线</view><view class="tiny">{{routeLabel || '从已有行程或已保存路线中选择'}}</view></view><text wx:if="{{route}}" class="event-selected" catchtap="removeRoute">移除</text><text wx:else class="event-selected">选择</text></view><view class="event-image-import {{selectedEventId?'':'event-image-import-disabled'}}" bindtap="importEventImages"><text>从关联事件导入图片</text><text>{{selectedEventId ? '导入' : '请先关联事件'}}</text></view><view class="publish-bottom-action"><button class="primary-btn {{publishing?'disabled':''}}" bindtap="publish" loading="{{publishing}}">{{publishing?'正在发布…':'发布经历'}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{pickerVisible}}" class="publish-picker-mask" catchtap="closePicker"><view class="publish-picker" catchtap="noop"><view class="picker-grabber"></view><view class="picker-head"><text class="picker-title">{{pickerTitle}}</text><text class="picker-cancel" bindtap="closePicker">取消</text></view><view class="picker-options"><view wx:for="{{pickerItems}}" wx:key="*this" class="picker-option" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="selectPicker"><text>{{item}}</text><text wx:if="{{(pickerKey==='region'&&region===item)||(pickerKey==='type'&&type===item)||(pickerKey==='stage'&&stage===item)}}" class="picker-check">✓</text></view></view></view></view>
<view class="section-title"><text>经历标签</text><text class="aside">必填</text></view><view class="stack gap-8"><view class="field" bindtap="selectRegion"><text class="field-label">地区</text><text class="field-value">{{region}}</text><image class="figma-icon sm" src="/assets/figma/all/s02-imgFrame2.svg"/></view><view class="field" bindtap="selectType"><text class="field-label">接触类型</text><text class="field-value">{{type}}</text><image class="figma-icon sm" src="/assets/figma/all/s02-imgFrame2.svg"/></view><view class="field" bindtap="selectStage"><text class="field-label">经历阶段</text><text class="field-value">{{stage}}</text><image class="figma-icon sm" src="/assets/figma/all/s02-imgFrame2.svg"/></view></view>
<view class="section-title"><text>经历内容</text><text class="aside">至少 20 字</text></view><view class="textarea-wrap"><view class="content-hint" wx:if="{{!text}}"><text>按“场景—处理—变化”来写，会更有参考价值</text><text>场景：在哪里、什么活动？</text><text>处理：当时做了什么？</text><text>变化：之后怎样、是否复查？</text></view><textarea class="post-textarea" value="{{text}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="1000"/></view>
<view class="section-title"><text>图片与关联</text><text class="aside">选填</text></view><view class="row gap-12 image-row"><view class="photo-add" bindtap="image"><text class="photo-plus">＋</text><view class="tiny">添加图片</view></view><view wx:for="{{images}}" wx:key="*this" class="image-preview"><image src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeImage">×</text></view></view><view class="card card-pad row associated" bindtap="chooseEvent"><view class="grow"><view>关联事件</view><view class="tiny">{{selectedEventLabel || '选择一条个人事件记录'}}</view></view><text wx:if="{{selectedEventId}}" class="event-selected" catchtap="clearEvent">移除</text><text wx:else class="event-selected">选择</text></view><view class="card card-pad row associated" bindtap="planRoute"><view class="grow"><view>关联路线</view><view class="tiny">{{routeLabel || '选择本次经历的路线'}}</view></view><text wx:if="{{route}}" class="event-selected" catchtap="removeRoute">移除</text><text wx:else class="event-selected">选择</text></view><view wx:if="{{route}}" class="safe-note" style="margin-top:24rpx">关联路线将向本帖读者公开路线摘要</view></view>
